"entity": {
"name": "Spectrum Brands Holdings, Inc.",
"description": "Spectrum Brands Holdings, Inc. engages in the manufacture, marketing and distribution of consumer products and home essentials. It operates through the following segments: Global Pet Care (GPC), Home and Garden (H&G), and Home and Personal Care (HPC). The GPC segment focuses on the pet care business which includes companion and aquatic animals. The H&G segment is involved in the home and garden, cleaning products, and insect control business. The HPC segment includes the small kitchen and personal care appliances business. The company was founded in 1906 and is headquartered in Middleton, WI.",
